-- L29-l1-anime-bank-lot1.rollback.sql (run O1, lane animebank; generated by apps/quiz/e2e/o1/L1/anime-bank-lot1-sql.mjs, do not edit by hand)
--
-- What:   undoes L29. The 27 lot rows go back to their exact L08 values (title, description, questions, status draft, no date, no verification, no notes)
